# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOTE: node_modules/ and vendor/ are deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# This hackathon has to run with no internet, so the dependencies and the
# GOV.UK Design System are committed to the repo on purpose. Students clone it
# and it just works - no npm install, no downloads.
#
# Don't "tidy this up" by ignoring them, or the whole thing stops working on
# the day.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
npm-debug.log*
.env
.vscode/
.idea/
